<title>USA: Career Horizons acquires Berger &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Career Horizons acquires Berger &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Career Horizons Inc said Wednesday it had acquired Berger &amp; Co for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Berger, a privately-held provider of information technology consulting and staffing services, with offices in Denver, Houston and Dallas, is projected to generate revenues of over $30 million in the year ending January 31, 1997, Career Horizons said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
